# Family relations: recursive rules and queries with several answers.

parent(tom, bob)
parent(tom, liz)
parent(bob, ann)
parent(bob, pat)
parent(pat, jim)

all X Y Z. (parent(X, Y) & parent(Y, Z) -> grandparent(X, Z))
all X Y. (parent(X, Y) -> ancestor(X, Y))
all X Y Z. (parent(X, Y) & ancestor(Y, Z) -> ancestor(X, Z))
all X Y Z. (parent(Z, X) & parent(Z, Y) & ~same(X, Y) -> sibling(X, Y))
all X. same(X, X)
~same(ann, pat)
~same(bob, liz)

? grandparent(tom, Who)
? ancestor(tom, jim)
? ancestor(Who, jim)
? sibling(ann, Who)
? grandparent(jim, tom)
